## 5. Full checklist for production‑ready handling

| ✅ Item | Why it matters |
|--------|----------------|
| **Listen to `styleimagemissing`** | Guarantees you only react to missing icons. |
| **Graceful fallback** (placeholder PNG **or** canvas) | Prevents the map from showing empty symbols. |
| **Cache images** (browser HTTP cache, `localStorage`/IndexedDB) | Reduces network traffic on repeated map loads. |
| **Add `sdf` flag when appropriate** | Enables runtime color changes without extra assets. |
| **Log missing‑icon events** (but not at `error` level) | Helps you discover typos in style JSON without spamming error monitors. |
| **Pre‑load known icons** (optional) | Improves first‑paint performance for frequently used symbols. |
| **Handle CORS** (ensure your icon host sends `Access-Control-Allow-Origin:*` or the same origin) | `fetchImage` will otherwise fail silently. |
| **Test offline** (e.g., with Service Workers) | Verify that your fallback or cached icons appear when the network is unavailable. |

