const bearing   = map.getBearing();
const pitch     = map.getPitch();
const projName  = map.getProjection();
const projMtx   = map.transform._projMatrix; // Float32Array(16)
```

That’s everything you need to do custom math with the current camera state. Happy coding! 🚀

